// 1-24: the walls have secrets. the floors have secrets.
id l1-24
name 1-24 SECOND SIGHT
tagline the walls have secrets. the floors have secrets.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main pull anchor white
mechanics current:22 plank:5 pull:11 anchor:9 yank:1 hack:1 capacitor:2 neon:3 white:6 secret:2
new -
portion 3.5 blocks 4 tall: double jump
portion 6.4 hop 5 floating blocks over current (heights 23213)
portion 7 capacitor gate 26 tiles away
portion 5.6 zip 3 anchors (high, mid, high), 9-7 apart, over current
portion 6.7 neon/white stones WWWnn (3 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 6 hop 3 pull ports (high, ceiling, ceiling), 8-8 apart, over current
portion 4.8 zip 2 anchors (high, ceiling), 8 apart, over current
portion 5 a low ceiling 10 long over a current notch
portion 4 a secret wall 8 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 5.5 two anchors up to the top lane
portion 6 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 22 gap (mid, mid anchors)
portion 7.1 capacitor gate 24 tiles away, a block on the way
portion 6.6 hop 4 pull ports (high, low, low, low), 7-8-8 apart, over current
portion 4.6 hack port opens a gate, 4-wide current beyond
portion 6 neon/white stones WnWW (2 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 6.6 hop 4 pull ports (high, ceiling, low, high), 8-7-8 apart, over current
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 21131)
portion 3 blocks 3 tall: double jump
hardness 5.6
map
